cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this conversion or the streaming executor, cite the repository."
title: "qwen-moe-stream: exact dense-to-MoE GGUF reformat and expert streaming"
abstract: >-
  A format-level conversion of Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 from a dense GGUF to an
  8-expert qwen3moe GGUF, with an exact full-fanout path, a measured top-k
  lossy path, and an mmap-based expert streaming executor.
authors:
  - family-names: Mkdad
    given-names: Noor
repository-code: "https://github.com/DrMkdaddy/qwen-moe-stream"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-11-01"
